 {"text": " "}, {"text": "confirmed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "culture"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "PCR (Polymerase Chain Reaction)."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1791"}}, {"id": "body-03129", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Laboratory Investigation", "runs": [{"text": "Laboratory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Investigation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-03130", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Specimen: Liquid stool or rectal swab", "runs": [{"text": "Specimen:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Liquid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stool"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rectal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "swab"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1791"}}, {"id": "body-03131", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Diagnostic test: Isolate V. cholerae from stool culture and determine O1 serotype using polyvalent antisera for V. cholerae O1. If desired, confirm identification with Inaba and Ogawa antisera.", "runs": [{"text": "Diagnostic test: Isolate V. cholerae from stool culture and determine O1 serotype using polyvalent antisera for V. cholerae O1. If desired, confirm identification with Inaba and Ogawa antisera."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1791"}}, {"id": "body-03132", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If specimen is not serotypeable, consider, V. cholerae O139", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "specimen"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "serotypeable,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "consider,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "V."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cholerae"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "O139"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1791"}}, {"id": "body-03133", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Antibiotic Susceptibility Testing before provision of antibiotics; Follow up 48 -72 hours after anti